      "Accessory uses and buildings are allowed in every residential district under Article VI. No accessory use or building may stand in the front yard, which includes the area in front of the house. Accessory structures over 500 sq ft: R-R 20 ft side and rear, 30 ft high. R-1 20 ft side, 15 ft rear, 15 ft high. R-2 10 and 10 ft, 15 ft high. R-3 5 ft side, 10 ft rear, 15 ft high. Smaller ones 5 ft from the property line (220-15)",
